  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.39 Structural glazing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.39 “Structural glazing” means the application of adhesive to bond glass, ceramic, metal, stone, or composite panels to exterior building frames.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
